"{\n  \"reasoning\": \"Increase gm of input pair to raise GBW. With Itail at the power limit (60\u202f\u00b5A) each input transistor carries 30\u202f\u00b5A. Choosing gm/Id=10\u202fV\u207b\u00b9 gives gm\u2248300\u202f\u00b5S per device, yielding GBW\u224823.9\u202fMHz (>20\u202fMHz). Length L=1\u202f\u00b5m keeps high output resistance for DC gain. Other devices unchanged to meet gain, PM, swing and power.\",\n  \"gmid1\": 10.0,\n  \"L1_um\": 1.0,\n  \"gmid3\": 10.0,\n  \"L3_um\": 1.0,\n  \"gmid5\": 6.0,\n  \"L5_um\": 0.5,\n  \"Itail_uA\": 60.0\n}"